      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Dear Sir Roger Deakins,"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I just noticed the look of “The Company Men” on Amazon Prime is quite different from the ones published by Blu-ray. Here is the picture attached, taken from trailer and screenshots provided by them; the Blu-ray ones have “Blu-ray” watermark on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I’m curious about which one was your intended look for the movie; the neutral look of Amazon Prime or the seemingly colder look by Blu-ray?"
    }
